    "gettingStartedTitle": "First-time guide | 7 steps",
    "gettingStartedIntro": "Work through these steps in order, then use Diagnosis, Compare and Chart to review your retirement plan. If you are unsure about an item, keep the automatic setting or use the “?” help.",
